| **Simple API Key** | Single text input | Password field with show/hide | OpenAI, Google, Groq, xAI, Mistral, OpenRouter |
| **OAuth** | Button + redirect flow | "Connect with X" button | GitHub Copilot, Google Cloud Code |
| **AWS Credentials** | Profile OR (Key + Secret + Region) | Toggle + conditional fields | Amazon Bedrock |
